# Append-only ledgers: union merge concatenates both sides instead of
# conflicting, which is exactly the semantics of an append-only file.
# ID allocation (LC-n, P-n, LAW-n) happens at task assignment so two
# branches never claim the same number; LAW entries are written by the
# integrator only, after rebase, because they embed gate-file hashes.
LAWCHANGES.md merge=union
LITCHECKS.md merge=union
PREDICTIONS.md merge=union
DECLINED.md merge=union
